The gap
  Task 4.13 needs one judge call per judge per diff through heavy-run.sh
  (spec D11, spec.md lines 488 to 537). No tool makes a judge call.
  `adjudicate.ts queue` writes
  `<private>/sets/<set_id>/adjudication/queue.json`, and
  `adjudicate.ts apply --judge-a <file> --judge-b <file>` reads two flat maps
  that map a finding id to `real-defect`, `false-claim`, or `unclear`
  (adjudicate.ts lines 1 to 78). The new tool is
  `harness/model-guide/judge-run.sh`. It fills that gap.

